9
01:05:34,285 --> 01:05:40,285
No End in Sight is a 2007 American documentary film
about the American occupation of Iraq.

10
01:12:51,428 --> 01:12:57,428
The directorial debut of Academy Award-winning documentary filmmaker Charles Ferguson, it premiered on January 22, 2007,
at the Sundance Film Festival and opened in its first two theaters in the United States on July 27, 2007.

11
01:20:08,571 --> 01:20:14,571
By December of that year, it had a theatrical gross of $1.4 million.

12
01:27:25,714 --> 01:27:31,714
The film was nominated for Best Documentary Feature at the 80th Academy Awards.

13
01:34:42,857 --> 01:34:48,857
The film explores themes of the white house, occupying
power, iraq, incompetence, super power.
